{
  "_meta": "G7 fragment (owner: SENSE7). Realistic senses + per-squad knowledge, read by sim/systems/senses7.gd (Senses7.cfg). Every number is PROVISIONAL (set by SENSE7; the plan did not settle them). Ranges are multipliers of the observer's def sight (tiles, ~7 m per tile); angles are half-angles in degrees from the head facing (e.facing). enabled=false gives the pre-G7 behaviour (no spot gate, no heard contacts, no squad snapshots). Match override: cfg.g7_senses (bool); rules.json override: rules.g7_senses.enabled.",
